 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Kamiyui Otome no Yomeiri - Mukae ni Kita Danna-sama to, Kamisama ni Otsukae shimasu."
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "髪結い乙女の嫁入り 迎えに来た旦那様と、神様にお仕えします。"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "A hair stylist without a single relative is entrusted with the care of a god as her marriage destination.\n\nOne day, Tengai Kaya, a hairdresser by trade, suddenly receives a blackmailing marriage proposal from a man of nobility. The man who reaches out to her in her time of need is Itsuki, a man with whom her late mother had a contract of marriage. She follows him and marries into a family that serves a god.\n\nThe story is a Japanese-style bride fantasy in which the bride struggles with her work!"
  },
